Release Notes="- Ships libzmq 4.3.4 (was 4.3.2) for 32-bit and 64-bit LabVIEW. Fixes an abort (“Socket operation on non-socket”) or error 1097 in lvzmq_recv_multi_timeout when a client is waiting while its server restarts.\0A- lvzmq32.dll and lvzmq64.dll are the 3.6.x binaries with their import name changed from libzmq-v120-mt-4_3_2.dll to libzmq-v120-mt-4_3_4.dll (one-byte patch, not recompiled). libsodium.dll from the same libzmq 4.3.4 release.\0A- Includes the 3.6.3 changes: compiled code separated from all library VIs and classes; debugging and automatic error handling disabled in all library VIs; zmq_recv_multi.vi reentrancy set to “preallocated shared”.\0A\0A*This version is a fork of labview-zmq by Martijn Jasperse, compiled by Patrick Irvin (ciozi137) with LabVIEW 2019 and VIPM 2025"
